Third-party notices
===================

ZaroPGx is built on other people's software and data. docs/user/credits.md
lists all of it with what it does here, its licence and the papers its authors
ask to be cited by; each report lists the parts its own run used. This file
records what the repository and the ZaroPGx images contain that is not
ZaroPGx's, and the terms that come with it.


1. In this repository
---------------------

app/static/vendor/ holds copies of these libraries, each with its own licence
file beside it. The interactive report carries Chart.js and D3 inside it, with
their licence texts.

- Bootstrap 5.3.2 (MIT), https://getbootstrap.com
  app/static/vendor/bootstrap/LICENSE
- Bootstrap Icons 1.11.1 (MIT), https://icons.getbootstrap.com
  app/static/vendor/bootstrap-icons/LICENSE
